  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Once Mariam picks up the HPOD, it connects to her mind and her vision
    is troubled for a moment as she hears the entity\u2019s (Silpha) voice for the
    first time.\r\n\r\nCall to action : Silpha wants Mariam to reach her. If Mariam
    reaches her, she will deem her worthy/intelligent enough to become her pupil.
    Silpha is creating the puzzles as tests for Mariam. Silpha is curious about what
    is Mariam and her capacities.\n\nAfter hearing the voice, the cube starts turning
    uncontrollably. This is due to Mariam\u2019s unconsciously controlling the HPOD
    through her mind while it is taking a second to adjust to the new connection.\n\nThe
    connection with the HPOD has stabilized with Mariam and she can now control it
    consciously. Mariam is surprised, shocked and confused about what just happened
    and wonders about the voice she heard."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
